{"time_ns": 1794070031992139000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 10, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "2be9dbc5c1ce3390663a847c151d94c47859aa5515f099b2da3062ba905f43b5", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Overview\nThis report summarizes the financial records across three regions for the complete ledger (24 records: R001-R024).\n\n## Results by Region\n\n| Region | Total (cents) | Total (dollars) |\n|--------|---------------|-----------------|\n| North  | 358,151       | $3,581.51       |\n| South  | 348,956       | $3,489.56       |\n| West   | 416,634       | $4,166.34       |\n| **Total** | **1,123,741** | **$11,237.41** |\n\n## Summary\nThe analysis covers all 24 records in the ledger. The West region has the highest total value ($4,166.34), followed by North ($3,581.51) and South ($3,489.56). The combined total across all regions is $11,237.41.\n\n## Data Quality\nAll 24 records were successfully processed. The complete reference data was required to obtain totals for all regions, as the initial workspace input file contained only 18 of the 24 records.\n", "ok": true}
